  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expansion of Kyanja Urban Agricultural Resource Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to expand the capacity of the Kyanja Urban Agriculture Resource Center. The center trains urban farmers and supplies high-quality inputs. The aim of this project is to develop the feasibility studies to expand Kyanja centre and recommend on marketing strategies to support urban farmers in Kampala.</narrative>
  </description>
